OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry at first
OL,6,Fwith some early evening sunny spells.
OL,7,FThen dry with clear spells overnight,
OL,8,Fthis allowing temperatures to become
OL,9,Fchilly and areas of fog to form,
OL,10,Fmainly in rural parts. Mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FEarly mist and fog patches
OL,13,Fwill slowly clear to leave another
OL,14,Ffine day, with bright or sunny spells.
OL,15,FSome rain arriving during the evening.
OL,16,FFeeling warm. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
