OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FBreezy
OL,6,Fwith rain, locally heavy, for much of
OL,7,FWednesday. Chilly start Thursday, then
OL,8,Fmostly dry with sunny spells. Wind and
OL,9,Frain arriving overnight, remaining
OL,10,Fdamp and breezy into Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
